Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really don't think\NI'm hero material.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're still alive! Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm all right. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:31.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The dragon calmed down\Njust like you told it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That really saved my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-no, I didn't! That wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the dragon stopped being hostile\Nall of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought it was because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That definitely wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.83,0:02:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are people who are scared of\Nand also hate that I have this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The dragon may be docile now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but just the fact he can control something\Nso ferocious is intimidating...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that's what you say,\Nthen we'll just leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If possible, can you send this dragon\Nback to where it came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, Sir Noor, this dragon is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,For sure, even I understand that\Nit's better to just kill it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if at all possible,\NI don't want to kill this dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know it's selfish of me to say that,\Nbut could you consider it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo, can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Given how powerful it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think the best I can do\Nis ask it politely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:17.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Neither Lynn nor Ines are afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it said it would do anything\Nits "master" orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-master?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This dragon really said that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, this hardly seems real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crazy to think that such a gigantic dragon\Nwould call him its "master."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, can you tell it to\Nquietly go back to where it came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And while we're at it,\Ntell it to never harm humans again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. I'll tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It says it understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's going to agree\Nto everything you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah... it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, that couldn't have gone\Nmore perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even a dragon that's\Nlived thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,is still just a stupid beast in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing more than my pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmph, I thought nothing would be left\Nof the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Commence the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're certain this will bring an end\Nto the Clays Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,A well-known beast tamer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,has already awakened the\NDragon of Calamity and brought it to heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:08:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess it was worth the high price\Nthey demanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then, after the dragon goes on a rampage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,our forces will march\Non the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,All foot soldiers will be equipped\Nwith magic swords and magic shields,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,while the elite troops will have\Nmagic armor and magic cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.63,0:08:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, we'll have three Aegises,\Nthe mobile mana-bulwark generation device,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,and four of the ultra-high output\Nmana ray weapon, Brionac.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:30.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is it, Randeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pardon my bluntness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I just don't see this war\Nbenefitting our country in the long run-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I beg you, please reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I said I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:09:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one can pose a threat to our empire\Nwhile we stand at the forefront
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,of magical technology!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And now we'll make sure\Nthe world knows it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,In the near future, this is the story\Npeople will tell of the Clays Kingdom:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That it was a country of fools\Nwho neglected proper upkeep
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:19.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,of the Dungeon of the Lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,led down a path to ruin\Nby their own selfish greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, we shall be remembered\Nas a humanitarian army
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,that liberated the people\Nfrom their idiot of a monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,History has no need\Nfor multiple storytellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,One truth is all that is needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,See, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. Is it alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know. We need to get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:09:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the Magical Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The princess, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next to her is Ines, the "Divine Shield."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,One of the living legends\Nknown all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she is the reason why\Nthe royal capital
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,has not been totally razed to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because the era where "legends" rule\Nhas already come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We now live in an era\Ndefined by those of us with wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fire the Brionac on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,She may be the "Divine Shield,"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,but the heat of the Brionac\Nwill evaporate her into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:11:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yet another one of these so-called\N"legends" will die by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:02.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, what bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is why I love going to war!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Brionac is prepared to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg, please stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm? What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I believe there may have been\Na misfire due to a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,with the mana condensation process...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn you half-wits!\NPrepare the next one immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What even was that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,More importantly,\Nlook at all those people...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you say that was the\Nimperial army?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:13:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Deridas the Third\Nhas mobilized his troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are thousands... no, maybe\Neven more than ten thousand of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What in the world is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,All we can say for sure\Nis that those brutes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,are here to try and\Nannihilate our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have an army in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,but not enough to put up a fight\Nagainst those numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything else here.\NLet's retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll retreat and meet up with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What will you do, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:33.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Considering the situation,\Ndo you even need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's really no other choice\Nbut to run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course. That was a silly question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is she smiling?\NDid she really understand what I meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:44.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I'm gonna run away t-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Attacks incoming! Get behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.21,0:13:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Divine Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,How aggravating!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, for safety's sake,\Ntake shelter in the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Finish the job, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'll keep us pinned here at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess there's only one way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get their attention\Nand buy some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You three should\Nuse that chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, Instructor...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm bad at fighting,\Nbut I'm pretty used to running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd often go hunting for honeycomb
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,and get attacked by bees\Nwhen I touched their hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I run around like crazy,\Nthings'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.67,0:14:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I plan on coming back alive,\Nso don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:03.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to offer you\Nwhat little I can to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she casting defense magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Prepare for impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm? Impact? Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll control the output this time,\Nso it'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Lynne!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You realize I'm not going out there for\Nsome kind of crazy suicide attack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's another shining light!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,The next one is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're leaving everything\Nin your hands now, Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Godspeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh crap! I'm not ready for the impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Physical Enhancement!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wind Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I escaped instant death somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good to know I can deflect those!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:17.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,My momentum is too strong\Nto change course at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,so here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll take it as far as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The more time that I manage to buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,the better chance Lynne\Nand the others have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna run around and\Nparry everything in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wha-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our weapons are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Defend yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have a shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:56.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are those big blocks up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That bastard again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on, haven't I seen you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense.\NThat man was way over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How did he cover\Nall that distance so quickly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is he looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,He pays no mind to the imperial guards\Nand looks only at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does he know I am the emperor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,In which case, I must be his target!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-he's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have my Kaiser Armor and Kaiser Sword\Nthat are both made of orichalcum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NDid you chicken out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.71,0:20:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are our cannons\Nsticking out of the ground like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had 10,000 soldiers\Nthat were all perfectly equipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Aegises that can defend against\Ndragon's breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.79,0:20:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even the Brionac\Nthat can burn dragons to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And now they're all worthless?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-who the hell are you?!\NWhy haven't you just killed me yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:46.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,King Clay's Black Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,The one dungeon relic\Nthat I want above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why does this man have it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don- don't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:57.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:20:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,As I recall, that sword was made from\Nan unknown metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be too heavy\Nfor any normal human to carry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've heard even that freakishly strong\Nking needed both hands to use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way anyone\Ncan surpass King Clays!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that's the only way to explain\Nwhat's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This man did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,He did all of this... by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:30.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The reason I'm still alive is because\Nhe wants me to endure the torture
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,of humiliation before\Nbrutally beating me to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's doing to me exactly what\NI was planning to do to King Clays!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.46,0:22:10.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,#9 I Parry an Army
